## Change risk tier

Tier 1 | 2 — justification: TO_RECORD (Tier 1 only for tests, fixtures, tools, evidence and non-governance docs with no protected path or risk flag; uncertain is Tier 2).

## Closure standard

FULL | DECLARED_LIMITATIONS — list each accepted limitation with attribution, or None: TO_RECORD.

## Scope and evidence

State objective, acceptance criteria, exact candidate, changed files, validation commands/results, independent reviews and unresolved risks. Describe configuration/permission changes and rollback. Do not include credentials or machine-local paths.

## Human decision

Link the current candidate-bound gate and genuine required authorization. A PR body or agent approval is not merge authority.
